  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3e4b5683c1ea36345958694d590b6436, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q3_OSInstall
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::QuizQuestionData
  questionText: Why is it important to install the correct chipset/motherboard driver
    first, before other drivers?
  choices:
  - "It's not important \u2014 order doesn't matter"
  - It changes the desktop wallpaper
  - It installs antivirus software
  - It enables the motherboard's core hardware (USB, SATA, etc.) to work properly,
    which other drivers may depend on
  correctChoiceIndex: 3
  points: 10
  explanation: The chipset driver lets Windows properly communicate with the motherboard's
    built-in hardware; other drivers can behave unpredictably without it.
